                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc9dd31c-b8ef-31af-b4ab-76028e5c3636",
                        "entry_id": "f368a667-a245-3e4b-bdc4-5270b2bbd9f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кино съёмка отдельных рисунков или объёмных фигур, изображающих последовательные фазы движения, что создаёт на экране иллюзию движения неподвижных объектов, а также сами рисунки, фигуры, являющиеся объектом такой съёмки"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "877d72d0-8e5c-45e8-847c-f4850de28e24",
                                "sense_id": "bc9dd31c-b8ef-31af-b4ab-76028e5c3636",
                                "text": "Дубляж ощущал себя настолько же ниже мультипликации, насколько мультипликация ниже игрового кино."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40fc619e-2870-3c45-9ec1-c09ff1de93b3",
                        "entry_id": "f368a667-a245-3e4b-bdc4-5270b2bbd9f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "фильм, сделанный посредством такой съёмки"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2d57b65-0bad-484b-a95a-4ffe93329783",
                                "sense_id": "40fc619e-2870-3c45-9ec1-c09ff1de93b3",
                                "text": "Кузенков стоял возле мерцающего телевизора, по которому катилась многоцветная мультипликация и откуда доносился детский писк."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1aaf6b4-3c35-4316-9bb3-8277196cfb96",
                        "source_entry_id": "f368a667-a245-3e4b-bdc4-5270b2bbd9f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "animation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "animation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f39d283-8287-3651-a885-e699a1ca4a08",
                                        "entry_id": "8b602e63-0d3f-3dc6-b024-f3f2ae9cb92a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of animating, or giving life or spirit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bb28720-fae0-422b-8995-4c1ce901948b",
                                                "sense_id": "3f39d283-8287-3651-a885-e699a1ca4a08",
                                                "text": "[…] by the animation of the same soul quickening that whole frame."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c30ef8c-0a52-3337-aa97-45553c576a19",
                                        "entry_id": "8b602e63-0d3f-3dc6-b024-f3f2ae9cb92a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sequence of still drawings or inanimate objects displayed in rapid succession to create the illusion of movement in motion pictures or computer graphics; the object (film, computer game, etc.) produced"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "deaf7d11-09fa-39cc-a82a-8c63358adfe3",
                                        "entry_id": "8b602e63-0d3f-3dc6-b024-f3f2ae9cb92a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being lively, brisk, or full of spirit and vigor; vivacity; spiritedness"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "853f1e63-2080-408a-9760-58ef8e31a529",
                                                "sense_id": "deaf7d11-09fa-39cc-a82a-8c63358adfe3",
                                                "text": "He recited the story with great animation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18c99f93-dff7-3d11-8ee4-c60109b0e421",
                                        "entry_id": "8b602e63-0d3f-3dc6-b024-f3f2ae9cb92a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being animate or alive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df562f2a-9f62-4fca-bbe8-1f3651574e05",
                                                "sense_id": "18c99f93-dff7-3d11-8ee4-c60109b0e421",
                                                "text": "Perhaps an inanimate thing supplies me, while I am speaking, with whatever I possess of animation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24ab101f-527f-3453-a91a-de488d84da15",
                                        "entry_id": "8b602e63-0d3f-3dc6-b024-f3f2ae9cb92a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "conversion from the inanimate to animate grammatical category"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e15efd5d-cf83-4329-931b-f5b529e60d43",
                                                "sense_id": "24ab101f-527f-3453-a91a-de488d84da15",
                                                "text": "\"The constraints are not so hard and fast that exceptional sentences do not occur. In particular animation and disanimation can temporarily suspend the system.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3dac802f-3b0d-38fd-a839-37dcb5ceb582",
